<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    Portable Dashboard layer for the OpenBurnBar WinUI port (Phase 3 · W7 —
    Dashboard: 5 concept layouts + easter-egg physics, Bucket C custom-canvas).

    This is the DEPENDENCY-FREE half of the Dashboard surface: the layout-switch
    state machine and the FULL frame-stepped easter-egg particle SIMULATION
    (logo-storm / cloud-token-rain / boundary-pop), plus its deterministic RNG and
    glyph sampler. It has NO WinUI / Win2D / Windows dependency on purpose — the
    SAME managed assembly is:
      • referenced by the WinUI app (windows/app/OpenBurnBar.App), whose
        DashboardPage + EasterEggCanvasHost STEP this simulation and DRAW its
        particle arrays with Win2D each frame (the analog of the SwiftUI
        TimelineView+Canvas that steps EasterEggSimulation on macOS), AND
      • unit-tested on the macOS authoring host today via `dotnet test`
        (windows/tests/dashboard) — stepping N frames and asserting deterministic
        positions / collisions / settle, exactly the pattern already proven by the
        particle perf harness and the presentation view-models.

    Parity sources (macOS):
      • AgentLens/Views/Dashboard/Components/EasterEggScene.swift
            -> EasterEgg/{SeededGenerator,EasterEggFx,EasterEggParticles,
                          GlyphSampler,EasterEggSimulation}.cs
      • AgentLens/Views/Dashboard/Components/EasterEggOverlay.swift
            -> EasterEgg/{EasterEggEvent,EasterEggController}.cs
      • OpenBurnBarCore/.../SharedModels/ThemePrimitives.swift (DashboardLayout)
        + AgentLens/Views/Dashboard/Layouts/Components/DashboardLayoutSwitcher.swift
            -> Layout/{DashboardLayout,DashboardLayoutState}.cs

    Targets net8.0 so the net8.0-windows WinUI app can reference it, while the
    net10.0 test project can reference it too (a lower TFM is consumable by a
    higher one) — identical to OpenBurnBar.App.Presentation.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>disable</ImplicitUsings>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <RootNamespace>OpenBurnBar.App.Dashboard</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>OpenBurnBar.App.Dashboard</AssemblyName>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
